Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:14:15 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] PixelOS: Expose ticker flags as public API for statusbar
 lyric detection

Android 17 hidden API enforcement classifies the custom
Notification.FLAG_ALWAYS_SHOW_TICKER / FLAG_ONLY_UPDATE_TICKER fields
as blocked, so music apps reflection (NetEase Cloud Music 9.6.22,
QQ Music 20.9.8.8 - mf0/b clinit / RemoteLyricController) fails with
NoSuchFieldException and their statusbar lyric option never shows up.

Remove the @hide annotation and add both fields to core/api/current.txt
so they land in the SDK API surface and hiddenapi assigns them the
whitelisted flag. Verified on device: the reflection denial was the
last blocker - the Meizu Build spoof already passed z3.U().

Note: Evolution-X cnb does not do this (checked core/api/current.txt
at 2026-11-16); its ticker mode is likely affected the same way,
consistent with their switch to LRCLIB-based lyrics.

Change-Id: I2bff878ebbd62ffa709b559032758948af4374d5
---
 core/api/current.txt                    |  2 ++
 core/java/android/app/Notification.java | 10 ++++++++--
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/api/current.txt b/core/api/current.txt
index 572012ca4643..c42c1940330a 100644
--- a/core/api/current.txt
+++ b/core/api/current.txt
@@ -6774,6 +6774,7 @@ package android.app {
     field public static final String EXTRA_TITLE_BIG = "android.title.big";
     field public static final String EXTRA_VERIFICATION_ICON = "android.verificationIcon";
     field public static final String EXTRA_VERIFICATION_TEXT = "android.verificationText";
+    field public static final int FLAG_ALWAYS_SHOW_TICKER = 16777216; // 0x1000000
     field public static final int FLAG_AUTO_CANCEL = 16; // 0x10
     field public static final int FLAG_BUBBLE = 4096; // 0x1000
     field public static final int FLAG_FOREGROUND_SERVICE = 64; // 0x40
@@ -6784,6 +6785,7 @@ package android.app {
     field public static final int FLAG_NO_CLEAR = 32; // 0x20
     field public static final int FLAG_ONGOING_EVENT = 2; // 0x2
     field public static final int FLAG_ONLY_ALERT_ONCE = 8; // 0x8
+    field public static final int FLAG_ONLY_UPDATE_TICKER = 33554432; // 0x2000000
     field public static final int FLAG_PROMOTED_ONGOING = 262144; // 0x40000
     field @Deprecated public static final int FLAG_SHOW_LIGHTS = 1; // 0x1
     field public static final int FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DEFAULT = 0; // 0x0
diff --git a/core/java/android/app/Notification.java b/core/java/android/app/Notification.java
index bb0388f72317..139453d5d7a2 100644
--- a/core/java/android/app/Notification.java
+++ b/core/java/android/app/Notification.java
@@ -760,13 +760,19 @@ public class Notification implements Parcelable
     public static final int FLAG_USER_INITIATED_JOB = 0x00008000;
 
     /**
-     * @hide
+     * Flag to make the ticker text persist until explicitly replaced or cancelled.
+     * Used by music apps to publish statusbar lyrics. Exposed as public API so that
+     * apps can reflect it despite hidden API enforcement.
      */
+    @SuppressLint("UnflaggedApi")
     public static final int FLAG_ALWAYS_SHOW_TICKER = 0x01000000;
 
     /**
-     * @hide
+     * Flag to make the ticker text update without re-posting the notification.
+     * Used by music apps to publish statusbar lyrics. Exposed as public API so that
+     * apps can reflect it despite hidden API enforcement.
      */
+    @SuppressLint("UnflaggedApi")
     public static final int FLAG_ONLY_UPDATE_TICKER = 0x02000000;
 
     /**
